:: Help_Menu {"position":"0,200","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
<div style="font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; color: #ccc; line-height: 1.2; padding: 10px;">

    <!-- SECTION 1 -->
    <h3 style="color: var(--accent-gold); margin: 0 0 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #444; padding-bottom: 5px; letter-spacing: 1px;">1. THE FATIGUE TAX</h3>
    <p style="color: #aaa; font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 5px 0;">Your Hunger and Thirst act as your body's fuel tank. If you let them drop, actions require far more energy.</p>

    <!-- Grouped items with 0 margin -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 2px;">
            <span style="color: var(--accent-blue); font-weight: bold;">● HEALTHY (50% - 100% Fuel):</span> 
            <span style="display:block; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 5px;">Actions cost <b style="color: #fff;">Normal</b> Stamina.</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 2px;">
            <span style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-weight: bold;">● EXHAUSTED (25% - 49% Fuel):</span> 
            <span style="display:block; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 5px;">Actions cost <b style="color: #fff;">1.5x</b> Stamina.</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 2px;">
            <span style="color: var(--accent-red); font-weight: bold;">● STARVING (0% - 24% Fuel):</span> 
            <span style="display:block; padding-left: 20px;">Actions cost <b style="color: #fff;">2.0x</b> Stamina!</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #333; margin: 5px 0;">

    <!-- SECTION 2 -->
    <h3 style="color: var(--accent-red); margin: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #444; padding-bottom: 5px; letter-spacing: 1px;">2. BURNING THE MUSCLE</h3>
    <p style="margin: 5px 0;">This world will rarely tell you "No." If an action requires more Stamina than you currently possess, <b style="color: var(--accent-red);">you can still attempt it.</b></p>
    
    <div style="background: rgba(158, 27, 27, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-red); padding: 5px; margin: 5px 0;">
        <b style="color: #fff;">CRITICAL OVER-EXERTION:</b><br>
        Pushing past your limits will drain your remaining Stamina to 0 and <b style="color: var(--accent-red);">rip the remaining cost directly from your HEALTH (HP).</b>
    </div>

</div>
<</nobr>>